==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|k|u}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*kumpu}}, probably from {{inh|fi|urj-pro|*kumpa||wave}}, whence also {{cog|hu|hab||foam}}. Contains a {{m|fi|-u}} suffix. Has also been compared with {{ncog|gem-pro|*humpaz}} (whence {{ncog|en|hump}}), possibly hinting at a borrowing from Germanic into Finnish.

